{
  "id": 2046,
  "name": "leaders-crest",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "古ぼけた　刃物のような　かけら。コマタナの　群れを　率いているキリキザンだけが　持っている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "오래된 날붙이로 보이는 조각. 자망칼 무리를 통솔하는 절각참만이 가지고 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "形似破舊刀刃的碎片。只有率領著駒刀小兵群體的劈斬司令才會持有。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fragment de ce qui semble être une épée usée par le temps. Seuls les Scalproie commandant un bataillon de Scalpion en possèdent une.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Bruchstück von etwas, das wie eine abgenutzte Klinge aussieht. Einzig Caesurio, die einen Trupp Gladiantri anführen, dürfen dieses Abzeichen tragen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fragmento de lo que parece una cuchilla desgastada. Solo la llevan los Bisharp que lideran grupos de Pawniard.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Frammento di quella che si direbbe una lama vecchia e rovinata. Solo ai Bisharp che guidano i gruppi di Pawniard è concesso l’onore di averne uno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A shard of what appears to be an old blade of some sort. It is held only by Bisharp that head up a group of Pawniard.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "古ぼけた　刃物のような　かけら。コマタナの　群れを　率いているキリキザンだけが　持っている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "像久经岁月的刃器一样的碎片。只有率领着驹刀小兵群体的劈斩司令能携带着。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fragmento de lo que parece una cuchilla desgastada. Solo la llevan los Bisharp que lideran grupos de Pawniard.",
